 <div style="color: #475569; margin-top: 3px;">Terminal Output: <code>&gt; [RBAC Auth] Validated token for role 'admin' • Access granted to /admin/metrics!</code></div>
 </div>
 <p class="mission-subtitle">Follow the step-by-step instructions below in the editor:</p>
 <div id="taskChecklist"></div>
 </article>
 
